ume with image generation, then publishing to Google Drive.\\nuser: [Mon 2026-05-18 06:55 UTC] An async command\\n\\nSource: memory/2026-05-18-telegram-pipeline.md#L51-L78\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/2026-05-18-telegram-pipeline.md#L51-L78\",\n      \"corpus\": \"memory\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provider\": \"none\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"debug\": {\n    \"backend\": \"builtin\",\n    \"effectiveMode\": \"n/a\",\n    \"searchMs\": 18,\n    \"hits\": 10\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"results":[{"id":"0728d1220377bb067114c519ad4dbef10724638b6c0cb2df977e69534a9235f9","path":"memory/2026-05-16-crypto-news.md","startLine":1,"endLine":46,"score":1,"textScore":0.39735351136574326,"snippet":"# Session: 2026-05-16 08:47:15 UTC\n\n- **Session Key**: agent:orchestrator:telegram:direct:5691449303\n- **Session ID**: 8633cf94-eee2-4784-9aa1-3403a81701c2\n- **Source**: telegram\n\n## Conversation Summary\n\nassistant: ✅ Article written, generating chart...\nassistant: ✅ Chart generated, generating feature image...\nassistant: ✅ Image generated, publishing to Google Drive...\nassistant: [[reply_to_current]] ✅ Crypto News Pipeline Complete!\n\n📰 Article: CLARITY Act lifts Bitcoin sentiment as BTC taps $82,000 after 15-9 vote  \n🔗 Google Doc: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HjKlODDgJtt8aCq3y8qlds_tTgnkaMIO/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=109667066179998081561&rtpof=true&sd=true  \n🖼️ Image: saved at /tmp/\n\nSource: memory/2026-05-16-crypto-news.md#L1-L46","source":"memory","citation":"memory/2026-05-16-crypto-news.md#L1-L46","corpus":"memory"},{"id":"64af08ddb3efc2fdbe53d6bac87f642e6e66c6ad879f880a35db04308c517a1c","path":"memory/2026-05-16-crypto-news.md","startLine":99,"endLine":136,"score":1,"textScore":0.38396655073587915,"snippet":"assistant: I’m checking the published draft and the handoff so I can tell you exactly why the chart didn’t make it in.\nassistant: I found the gap — the article file does contain the chart, but the WordPress publish step w