{"type":"message","id":"98cbd6cf","parentId":"bdb8df1f","timestamp":"2026-05-18T08:29:19.386Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"By “go deeper,” I mean I can help at the next level of detail, depending on what you want.\n\nFor example, I can give you:\n\n1. **A developer-ready fix spec**  \n   - exact changes to make\n   - what each agent should return\n   - what validations to add\n\n2. **A step-by-step implementation roadmap**  \n   - what to fix first\n   - what gives biggest stability gain\n   - what can wait\n\n3. **A failure-mode audit**  \n   - every place the pipeline can break\n   - symptom → root cause → recommended fix\n\n4. **A test plan**  \n   - how to test the pipeline safely\n   - what to verify after each step\n   - how to catch regressions early\n\n5. **A contract/schema design**  \n   - exact JSON format for researcher, writer, publisher, wp-publisher, etc.\n\n6. **A recovery/resume design**  \n   - how to resume from failed steps\n   - how to avoid rerunning everything\n   - how to prevent stale files from confusing the pipeline\n\nSo “deeper” basically means: **less advice, more exact blueprint**.\n\nIf you want, I can do the most useful next one:\n**a full developer-ready fix spec for the pipeline.**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":312,"output":271,"cacheRead":55808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56391,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779092952533,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DgnddYAjH1QfHpdmkzRLSNJA4AHF8"}}
